# A repository of this project holds the project's own files and nothing
# else, see LEGAL.md: everything is left out, then those files are let back
# in by name. The work files stay on this computer: the game's code and what
# is made from it (_work/, FireEmblemAwakeningRecomp/, _runs/),
# the Zakuro and 3dsrecomp clones the patches apply to, the development
# notes, the toolchain, hints, the mods other than the feet mod's own files,
# and logs. A new file goes in only once it's let in here, and only if it
# holds nothing from the game.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/.recomp.json
!/README.md
!/LEGAL.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

!/patches/
/patches/*
!/patches/*.patch

!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/*.py
!/tools/*.sh

!/mods/
/mods/*
!/mods/feet/
/mods/feet/*
!/mods/feet/*.py
!/mods/feet/README.md
!/mods/feet/zakuro-feet.patch

__pycache__/
*.pyc
